Navigate to Site Administration / Server / Ad-hoc tasks trigger the following error:
{code:java}
Deprecated: Creation of dynamic property html_table_cell::$class is deprecated in /admin/tool/task/renderer.php on line 85{code}

!Screenshot 2023-11-08 at 11.03.27.png|width=925,height=469! Starred Courses when in Drawer Right, when the screen size is at or under 575px .dashboard-card has 
width: calc(100% - #\{$card-gutter}); 

This is making a negative margin or something that is causing it to be off-centered in the column.

# Convert the report to RB;
# Add filters;
# Allow preset to be renamed with inplace editable (*why* can we not edit preset data once created?! Very annoying);
# Use JS confirmation of deletion

Found a bug with deletion, will report separately

In MDL-78334 ([deprecated.scss:40|https://github.com/roland04/moodle/commit/8bca00cd5915e04c49c7492b5778a21478e86fa7#diff-29188cadaa81abf22c7cef2ae81ee6b2d3651cebbc8997f64cbeec8febc94cacR40]) some SCSS was deprecated, but no "Since" version was included in a comment. That is needed to accomplish the [final deprecation|https://moodledev.io/general/development/policies/deprecation/scss-deprecation#final-deprecation] process.

The following comment should be added before the deprecated SCSS code for every version:
{code:java}//
// Deprecated since Moodle X.Y.
// {code}

After MDL-72656 deprecation, many renderers and templates were changed or removed, so many lines of SCSS code could be potentially removed.

There is a comment in course.scss file noting it:
{code}
// These are the new styles for the renewed course UI in isssue MDL-71691
// once the old course renderers are removed in MDL-72656, all css related
// to activities and sections above this commend needs to be reviewed an
// possibly removed. 
{code}
